doubtful cases are resolved in favor of coverage.

"Installation Information" for a User Product means any methods,
procedures, authorization keys, or other information required to
install and execute modified versions of the covered work in that
User Product, ensuring that the continued functioning of the modified
version is in no way prevented by such modification. If you convey
an object code work under this License in a User Product, and the
conveying is part of a commercial transaction in which the User Product
